    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "California-based animator, illustrator and film director (b. Ukraine 1982; fine arts + applied maths, then animation at Vancouver Film School and Estonian Academy of Arts under Priit Parn). Works freelance from a home studio on indie films plus commercial/editorial commissions. Clients confirm the clip note: Hermes, Klarna, YouTube, Google, Microsoft, NYT, The New Yorker, WSJ, Hyatt. Award-winning indie filmmaker (Grand Prix, Golden Kuker 2025; Satoshi Kon Award, Fantasia 2025, plus Tokyo/Berlin festival awards). Senior, ~15+ yrs; fully autonomous (5), directs and authors her own films and commissions. Freelance confirmed by her own site (independent, home studio) and consistent festival/editorial track record. Sources: her site (about/contact), Behance, Vimeo, search.",
